# Force LF regardless of platform `core.autocrlf` — a shell script checked out
# with CRLF fails at `exec` inside a Linux container: `#!/bin/sh\r` names an
# interpreter that does not exist, and it fails as "no such file or directory"
# even though the file is there. See docs/DECISIONS.md.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
